The project leverages the Credit Card Fraud Detection Dataset from Kaggle.
Work Done

Data Analysis:
Explored and visualized the dataset to understand patterns and feature distributions.
Analyzed the severe class imbalance in the target variable.

Handling Class Imbalance:
Used SMOTE to balance the dataset and improve model performance.

Model Training:
Implemented a Random Forest Classifier for fraud detection.
Evaluated the model using metrics like Precision, Recall, F1-Score
